<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gen Opt lifts half yr shr, declares div.</title>
<headline>Gen Opt lifts half yr shr, declares div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     24.40	  vs   15.10</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  5.00	  vs    -</p>
<p>    Net income		 1.82	  vs    0.90</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    2.99	  vs    1.54</p>
<p>    Tax			  1.10	  vs    0.53</p>
<p>    Turnover		  51.71	  vs   45.07</p>
<p>Div payable around March 24</p>
<p>on register February 21</p>
<p>Full name: Gerneral Optical Company Ltd (industrial -</p>
<p>pharmaceutical &amp; medical)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
